<title>AUSTRALIA: Greenfields has Smorgon financial deal.</title>
<headline>Greenfields has Smorgon financial deal.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenfields Coal Co Ltd, the developer of the Alpheus coal reclamation plant in the United States, said on Friday that it had reached agreement with a company associated with the Victor Smorgon Group to provide interim financing of up to A$2.6 million.</p>
<p>The company said the Victor Smorgon Group had also agreed in principle to underwrite a recently-announced one-for-five renounceable rights issue with an attached one-for-one bonus share.</p>
</text>
